# GitLab Pages redirect rules, copied to the root of public/ by the `pages`
# job. See .gitlab/ci/docs.yml.
#
# The book is served from /xquad/, so the host root would otherwise be a dead
# end. Send it to the main Quip documentation. Domain-level (external)
# redirects are generally available since GitLab 17.4 and accept only 301/302.
#
# The rule matches the root path exactly, so /robots.txt, /404.html and
# everything under /xquad/ are unaffected.
/ https://quip.gitbook.io/docs 301
